</div>

<div class="data-notice">
    <strong>Data Coverage Note:</strong> This dataset contains <strong>50,000 listings</strong> across <strong>7 cities</strong> (London, Paris, Rome, Bangkok, Barcelona, Sydney, Amsterdam). The original brief referenced 10 cities; New York, Tokyo, and Los Angeles are absent from the provided dataset. Additionally, <strong>Paris and Sydney have zero price data</strong> (all price values are null) and are excluded from all pricing analyses. Bangkok prices appear significantly elevated (median $1,400), likely reflecting incomplete currency normalization &mdash; interpret Bangkok pricing comparisons with caution. All figures are derived directly from <code>data.csv</code>; no values have been imputed or fabricated.
</div>

<div class="toc">
